\title{AdvancedRlab4: Multiple Linear Regression}
\description{
Provides functions for fitting multiple linear regression models
using ordinary least squares and QR decomposition.
}
\details{
The package provides two functions for fitting linear regression
models:

\itemize{
\item \code{linreg()} fits a linear regression model using
ordinary least squares.
\item \code{linreg_qr()} fits a linear regression model using
QR decomposition.
}

Both functions return an object of class \code{linreg}. S3 methods
are provided for printing, summarizing, extracting coefficients and
residuals, obtaining predictions, and producing diagnostic plots.
}
